# The bytes of a streamed answer (`.prd/tui-phase4` T8): one prompt, an
# answer that arrives a few words at a time across two paragraphs, then the
# wire -- which writes a synchronized update brackets, and whether the rows
# the answer adds are inside the same update as the band under them.
gateway stream-wire-turns.json
wait 2
type stream please
key Enter
wait 4
snap end
snapfull end
wire end
